</RTL><BRK/><BRK/></REF><REF><ORG>SOUTH COAST AIR QUALITY MANAGEMENT DISTRICT (SCAQMD)</ORG><BRK/><BRK/><RID>SCAQMD Rule 1168</RID><RTL>(2022) Adhesive and Sealant Applications</RTL><BRK/><BRK/></REF><REF><ORG>UL SOLUTIONS (UL)</ORG><BRK/><BRK/><RID>UL 183</RID><RTL>(2009) UL Standard for Safety Manufactured Wiring Systems</RTL><BRK/><BRK/><RID>UL 2818</RID><RTL>(2022) GREENGUARD Certification Program For Chemical Emissions For Building Materials, Finishes And Furnishings</RTL><BRK/><BRK/></REF></SPT><SPT><TTL>SUBMITTALS</TTL><BRK/>
